          "git_sha": "8c40b294cad8457fc7d2a3bdfbfe57cc1e8cc6be",
          "line_end": 217,
          "line_start": 180,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "jcast90/relay",
          "url": "https://github.com/jcast90/relay/blob/7bd5a2f6a13ce62db53ca3c55f2a7ef89e36e710/README.md#L180-L217"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_ea9f4eee4222e71156466095a550778ec1f84b48f804d4e0bb11f0a58718b771"
      ],
      "text": "The pipeline runs classifier → planner (design doc if architectural) → decomposer into a dependency-DAG of tickets → scheduler running tickets in parallel capped by max-concurrency, then implement/verify/retry until a PR opens."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_44a45558cbb503f5be92c798957d58923e76e1d616be147648a8dc056b074539",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
