      ],
      "text": "Relay exposes an MCP server to Claude and Codex with harness tools (e.g. harness_approve_plan, harness_dispatch), channel tools (channel_create, channel_record_decision, channel_handoff_finalize), and crosslink tools (crosslink_discover/send/poll); rly inspect-mcp lists the live set."
    },
