        "slc_ab3f9a4a32c5dfa71d723e09d6dee4ac48bd10000595cb3327ba922aa7708895"
      ],
      "text": "The two CLI adapters (claude, codex) accept any endpoint speaking their wire protocol, so OpenAI- or Anthropic-compatible HTTP providers work by setting base-URL and key env vars; named profiles reference env-var names rather than storing secrets."
    },
