      ],
      "text": "All state lives in ~/.relay/ as JSON/JSONL files with atomic tmp+rename writes, accessed through a single HarnessStore interface; channels hold feed.jsonl, tickets.json, decisions/<id>.json, sessions, and handoff briefs."
    },
