      ],
      "text": "Verification runs through an Executor abstraction whose only shipping implementation is LocalChildProcessExecutor; a pod-based executor was prototyped and removed, and a Postgres HarnessStore backend is stubbed but not wired (HARNESS_STORE=postgres falls back to files)."
    },
