  "summary": "Selected evidence records: Relay converts a sentence, GitHub issue URL, or Linear ticket into a running plan: classify, plan, decompose into a ticket DAG, dispatch to Claude or Codex agents, verify, open a PR, and track until merged. The project is explicitly beta, pre-v1: APIs, CLI flags, ~/.relay file layouts, and GUI surfaces may change between releases, and users are asked to file issues with reproductions.",
